            <div xml:id="d995">

                <pb facs="0670" n="598" xml:id="pg598"/>

                <head>Government of the Canton of Schwyz</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schwyz</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-10">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 10, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Council of the Canton of Schwyz to the honorable
                        Bundesrath, in Berne</hi>:</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: The news of the heinous crime of the
                    murder of Abraham Lincoln, the worthy President of the great republic of the
                    United States of North America, who had won the esteem not only of his own
                    country, but of the whole world, has filled the hearts of the people of this
                    canton with the deepest grief. We feel ourselves compelled to join in the
                    general lamentation now expressed everywhere, and therefore request you to
                    convey these our true sentiments to our brethren of the United States of North
                    America.</p>
                <p>With highest respect, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>J. A. STEINEGGER, <hi rendition="#italic">President</hi>.</item>
                            <item>A. EBERLE, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
